    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Girgweageeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda Amoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iita fuga Amoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea iing'ata ng'asheesu gaydeaguumsa fuga Amoni miyeenooda nyaawa, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Girgweageeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda Edomu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA: “Fugiga mamiisiina gideaba gayghwaleayda bayooktean gayghwaleayda, neada gajea mealasnyi? Majuna nea mealasnyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba aniini naayaaji habeawooda, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, bea gideaba Bosra gajea muy, ak ea haloat, ea gidarearga, ea gidamuy, ea mooshteayda; nea mujiinajeagaaschi gayghoah eemeega galeagasean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak Edomu, gajea haloat, nea gilinyoo ea sih nyooh ghang'ata gayghahamng'eanyi nea gabara reari aba badayda sawanaduutkaaschi sean jea ghwanyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaygawuurji gidaghayi sibwaayda busiinda Sodoma ea Gomora sea mujiinajeega neekeewa, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, manda siida jea goobiida jeeda, ak ea manda siida jea goobiida gicha jeedida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, gaygwascheeng'deayda ng'adiida leabu dareabeeta Yordani ak gawa heeda haghweeda miy nih gichea dahoanda Edomu nea geashamnyi gil; ak gaydanung' ghoahaaghwa eemeeda siida jea daloat. Aba gideaba neada gawuurjeewean ng'eaha? Ak gayghoamu ng'eaha goorgweaksean? Ak ea ana jeagiischoochean gil dea ammu ghamiinaada aba madeedeanyu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi iinya gidabada NG'UTAMIIDA sinooda aba badayda Edomu ea gidagasa sinooda aba badahuuka fuga abiita Demani. Ak eara dayeega manang'i bea gisilga gajeengiir; aba huumwa gaygwanda hamoodeaba ng'eanyiida aba heeda was hoorgeeda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasim geaw ng'eanyiida aba nyeashta giibeedeayda nyaawa; nea ghuuta shooka nyaawa gajeayiiy aba basooda Shaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, weajoocheanda gaygwascheeng'u ak ghang'eataayda rabearda, ak ghoayaaw meang'eagaaschi aba badayda Bosra, ea badayda gurooruunatka fuga meanyi bea Edomu abeeda eaweedida gaygawuurji guroorooda gatmooda eaweeda lajooda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Girgweageeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda Dameski",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Girgweageeda eemeeda Gedari ea mujiineeda Hasori",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Girgweageeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda Elamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwahidu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Yeremiya was sibaneeda aba badayda Elamu, aba damanda giing'eeta sugoocheanduumeeda Sedekiya was sugoocheanda Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega: “Ng'ula, gaydahirja ghuweang'da Elamu, was dea haw was uurda nyaawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaydeadu badayda Elamu jeameeda aba meadaji ang'wan biissa gwaleabu meadaji ang'wan bea humng'eeda; ak gaydanung' gwadarsa jeameedida seaniin, ak ea manda eemeeda mayghwahita heeda fuga Elamu ghayi sihoan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydanung' ghabeal fuga Elamu aba madeeda weajoodiga nyaawa, ea madeedeaba fugiga gaseadayi gurooruunatka nyaawaan; ak gaydeadu ng'asheega munyas badahuuka nyaawa, was nyarasteanyu ng'waan, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA. Ak aniini gaydeamaseaw saawa ng'uta, bwak ea dalas uhuuda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaydeambiit hoorgeedeanyu aba Elamu, ak ghaabwarji sugoocheanda sea fuga hees, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea aba eawoojiga jea ghwahidu gaydeadeelu giibinda fuga Elamu, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
